id: energy-gathering
name: Energy Gathering
uaType: both
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
tpCost: 20
type: standard
# "1~3 Actions": how many, asked.
actionCost: 1
actionCostMax: 3
kiCost: 0
# "For each Action spent, gain a stack of Lifeforce from the planet you are on" (use-maneuver.mjs postGathering); with a
# Genki Dramatic Finisher, the Energy Charge Maneuver out of sequence for it; any other Maneuver, a Karma Point or the
# stacks (chat.mjs lifeforceOnManeuver).
gathers: true
# "The maximum amount of Lifeforce stacks you can possess is equal to 3x your number of Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance."
resource: lifeforce
resourceMaxFrom: skills.clairvoyance.ranks
resourceMaxTimes: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A stack of Lifeforce for each Action spent (1~3), at most 3 per Clairvoyance Rank; with a Genki Dramatic Finisher, the
  Energy Charge Maneuver at once with Charges from it. Another Maneuver costs a Karma Point or every stack.
text: >
  Energy Gathering: By reaching out to the world around you, you draw in the natural energy of your environment.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
  –TP Cost: 20
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1~3 Actions
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: For each Action spent, gain a stack of Lifeforce from the planet you are on. If you possess a Dramatic Finisher
  with the Genki Super Profile, you may use the Energy Charge Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver, but you must
  declare that Signature Technique for its effects. If you do, instead of gaining 1 Energy Charge through its effects,
  gain a number of Energy Charges equal to 1 less than the amount of Lifeforce stacks you gained through the effects of
  the Energy Gathering Unique Ability.

  If you use a Maneuver other than the Signature Technique Maneuver, Energy Charge Maneuver, or Energy Gathering Unique
  Ability, you must spend a Karma Point or lose all stacks of Lifeforce.

  The maximum amount of Lifeforce stacks you can possess is equal to 3x your number of Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance.
